<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">JON ro Nyichiieng pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Jon</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ro Nyichiieng Pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jon ro nyichiieng pha jigi </char> ne dukho jia è “Bimi nane airo aniphiing” Ji pha miyaosiu ne thiig pha charch nane migiphothek shii zey. Hì pha mua zey ne khia pha jine jia è jia chung miie pha nane asi pha masdothek chiih-è ithek muyuathek pha ji shii phriie ro.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Miie pha miigak ithua <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">4-6</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asi pha yua pho shii phriie <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">7-11</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jong sha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">12-13</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Dukhow è—Bimi nane ai aniphiing shii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bimi nane, airo aniphiing: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ji pha miyaosiu ne thiig pha charch nane migiphothek shii zey (ithoh 4-5 shii de um).</char></note> hanyie shii gu è zai miie ithek shii zey. Chiih-è gu jia è asi bie ro, jishii zab hanyie yi zai è nathek shii miie rone ìd pho è ro, <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>nyieliieshii zai è gethek rog shii chiih-è jine gethek rog idang rai ro. <verse eid="2JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Aphuii Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Isu Masi, Aphuii ro Dufuii, gethek shii bushun nane liijiing phi; jithek ne zai nane miie shii idang gethek ro rey ne rai bo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zai nane miie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Aphuii è gethek shii yung pha duiine nathek aniphiing khuyo shii zai hà rai pha doh, gu ne bajo sang ro. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34-15:12">Jon 13:34—15:12-17</ref></char></note> Chiih-è ji è gu ne nathek shii sai, bushun bimi: cho zab gethek chung miie rai haro. Gu ne nathek shii zey pha hìne muyung iwo asi ro. Hì ne nyie gethek shii igobi è um pha ji ro. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Gu è hìpha miie chiang yao pha miyaosiu ne gethek Hamangkhung-aphuii ro muyung shii nuii ne rai chid phro. Muyung, nathek è igobi è zab yoi pha duiine, nathek ne zab miie shii rai chid phro.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Khinrinpho ne sohjambling shii bajo thog ro, bran hanyie yi Isu Masi shii tharothamang rey ne wuii rone anuii pho, Ji pha branthek ne khlampha nane Masi ro Suangpho ro. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Chiihphado, nawaithek shii ragia rek bo, ji è gethek è nyie blia rek pha jine amua pha asi ro, jishii nathek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gethek; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizeythek shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nathek.</char></note> lasen jine ley choi ruii phro.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Hanyie jia è Masi ro muyua rog shii arai pha ji è ruang rey anine, aishii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii oi ro. Hanyie magunde muyua shii rai anine Aphuii nane Dufuii nyimanyi aishii um ro. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Ji-è gai hanyie yi nathek shii ji pha muyua ayie pha wuii arone aishii ne nathek hò hà aho rabo, “liijiing nathek rog um bo de ayao rabo.” <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Hanyie magunde liijiing ithek rog um bone yao arone, ai ne ithek è awiepha blia rog shii iijiiak rey ruii phro.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha miyaogamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Gu ne nathek shii yao pha bajo um, jishii hìpha blia ne gu ne jigi nane kholom è azey yang ro, Ji phachiang, gu ne hì luthong nathek shii si din ne chiih-è nathek rog gui sbang è yao, ji-anine gethek ro lised ji zabjong pha rey phro. <verse eid="2JN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Bushun pha bumuiithek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bushun pha bumuiithek naro anithek: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ji pha miyaosiu ne zeypho re-è thiig pha charch nane migiphothek shii zey.</char></note> naro anithek è ithek ro salam nathek shii thoh gey ro.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
